== Trivia ==
* [[anti:Uranus|Uranus]] originates from the ''Antibirth'' mod. In ''Antibirth'', Uranus used to be overridden if Isaac also obtained {{i|Terra}}.
* Uranus' effects reference the planet [[Wikipedia:Uranus|Uranus]]' nature as an [[Wikipedia:Ice giant|ice giant]], being composed mainly of water, ammonia, and methane in gas and liquid form.
* {{dlc|rnr+}} {{i|Jar of Flies}} used to only add flies, in case enemies' ice statues were shattered by player's tears or bombs.
** {{dlc|r+}} Statues shattered by kicking also add a fly.

